@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms and Conditions";
    ViewData["MetaDescription"] = "Read the terms for using the Ubhaya Fashions online store and placing orders.";
}

<section class="policy-page">
    <h1>Terms and Conditions</h1>
    <p>By using the Ubhaya Fashions online store, you agree to use the site lawfully and to provide accurate information when creating an account or placing an order.</p>
    <h2>Products and orders</h2>
    <p>Product availability, sizes, colors, and prices are shown on the relevant product pages and may change. An order is subject to product availability and successful payment.</p>
    <h2>Delivery</h2>
    <p>Delivery details are described in our <a asp-controller="Shipping" asp-action="Index">shipping information</a>. Please provide a complete and accurate delivery address.</p>
    <h2>Product issues, returns and refunds</h2>
    <p>If an item arrives damaged, defective, missing, or different from what you ordered, contact us as soon as reasonably possible with your order number and available photos or other details. An unboxing video can help with the review, but not having one does not prevent you from contacting us or exercising applicable consumer rights.</p>
    <p>See our <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Returns">Returns, Refunds &amp; Product Issues Policy</a> for guidance on reporting an issue. Nothing in these terms limits rights that cannot lawfully be excluded under applicable consumer-protection law.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>If you have a question about these terms or an order, please use the <a asp-controller="Contact" asp-action="Index">contact page</a>.</p>
</section>
